      "writtenOn": "2023-06-06T00:39:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m virtually certain this doesn\u0027t work.\nYou need to prefix the 32-bit ipv4 address with the 96-bit clat prefix.\nNot with ::fffff like a v4 mapped address.",
