      "writtenOn": "2023-06-08T08:58:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This looks wrong to me. Before this patch, the addresses could be v6. Now it\u0027s forbidden (you require that dstAddress is a Inet4Address in all code branches).",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 744,
        "startChar": 23,
